(Project Summary & Technical Presentation) Tj
54 636 m 558 636 l S
/F1 11.0 Tf
0.118 0.118 0.118 rg
54.0 606.0 moveto
(AstraVitals is an offline-first crew health monitoring platform designed for space mission) Tj
54.0 592.0 moveto
(environments where network connectivity is intermittent or absent. It combines an Electron) Tj
54.0 578.0 moveto
(desktop application with a FastAPI ground backend to continuously track six critical) Tj
54.0 564.0 moveto
(astronaut vitals: heart rate, blood pressure \(systolic and diastolic\), blood glucose, body) Tj
54.0 550.0 moveto
(temperature, and sleep duration.) Tj
54.0 528.0 moveto
(The challenge it addresses is the high-stakes problem of monitoring astronaut health during) Tj
54.0 514.0 moveto
(long-duration space missions where real-time communication with Earth is not always) Tj
54.0 500.0 moveto
(possible. In the isolated environment of a spacecraft, space station, or planetary base,) Tj
54.0 486.0 moveto
(crew members must be able to log vital readings, receive immediate interpretation and) Tj
54.0 472.0 moveto
(guidance, and maintain a local encrypted record of their health data -- all without relying) Tj
54.0 458.0 moveto
(on a constant connection to mission control.) Tj
54.0 436.0 moveto
(AstraVitals is important because astronaut health monitoring in space presents unique) Tj
54.0 422.0 moveto
(challenges not addressed by terrestrial health platforms. The system must operate entirely) Tj
54.0 408.0 moveto
(offline, encrypt all sensitive health data on the device using AES-256-GCM with a) Tj
54.0 394.0 moveto
(non-extractable key stored in IndexedDB, provide clinically validated interpretation of) Tj
54.0 380.0 moveto
(vital signs using threshold-based classification with trend analysis and combined-signal) Tj
54.0 366.0 moveto
(escalation, and sync data to the ground station when connectivity is restored via a) Tj
54.0 352.0 moveto
(delay-tolerant networking \(DTN\) outbox queue with Ed25519-signed, SHA-256-hashed sync) Tj
54.0 338.0 moveto
(bundles.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj

