(Encrypted Storage) Tj
54.0 371.0 moveto
(All health data is encrypted at rest using AES-256-GCM via the WebCrypto API. The) Tj
54.0 357.0 moveto
(encryption key is generated as a non-extractable CryptoKey and stored in a separate) Tj
54.0 343.0 moveto
(IndexedDB object store \(the 'keys' store\), so a raw disk copy of the database does not) Tj
54.0 329.0 moveto
(expose health data. An attacker running code in the same origin can still request) Tj
54.0 315.0 moveto
(decryption -- which is why a real deployment also requires a passphrase or hardware key. The) Tj
54.0 301.0 moveto
(store supports five object stores with appropriate indexes for astronaut, metric,) Tj
54.0 287.0 moveto
(recordedAt, status, and createdAt queries. Database schema versioning is tracked via) Tj
54.0 273.0 moveto
(DB_VERSION in db-config.ts.) Tj
