(Containerization & Kubernetes) Tj
54.0 682.0 moveto
(The application uses a multi-stage Dockerfile. The builder stage installs dependencies and) Tj
54.0 668.0 moveto
(runs next build. The production stage copies only the .next output, public assets,) Tj
54.0 654.0 moveto
(package.json, and production dependencies -- minimizing image size and attack surface. Port) Tj
54.0 640.0 moveto
(3000 is exposed. docker-compose.yml defines three services: Next.js app \(port 3000\),) Tj
54.0 626.0 moveto
(PostgreSQL 15 \(port 5432\), and optional Redis \(port 6379\). Credentials come from) Tj
54.0 612.0 moveto
(environment variables, not hardcoded values.) Tj
54.0 590.0 moveto
(K8s manifests include a Deployment \(2 replicas, 500m CPU / 512Mi memory,) Tj
54.0 576.0 moveto
(liveness/readiness/startup probes on /healthz\), a ClusterIP Service \(port 80 -> 8000\), and a) Tj
54.0 562.0 moveto
(LoadBalancer Service. A ConfigMap provides NODE_ENV and NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME. Secrets are) Tj
54.0 548.0 moveto
(referenced from a separate Secret resource -- no credentials are committed to the) Tj
54.0 534.0 moveto
(repository. The previous committed base64 secrets have been removed and replaced with) Tj
54.0 520.0 moveto
(stringData placeholders.) Tj
/F2 13.0 Tf
0.086 0.314 0.627 rg
54.0 494.0 moveto
(Configuration) Tj
54.0 478.0 moveto
(Environment variables: DATABASE_URL \(PostgreSQL connection string\), ASTRA_API_KEY \(API key) Tj
54.0 464.0 moveto
